# Generated simulation data and exports -- large, reproducible from the
# generator scripts + seeds, doesn't belong in git. (Data/* instead of
# Data/ so the exception below can still reach inside the directory --
# git won't apply a file-level negation to a fully-excluded directory.)
Data/*

# RL training logs/checkpoints (tensorboard events, PPO checkpoints) and
# scratch training logs -- reproducible from a training run, not source.
Synthetic data creation/Simulation/rl_logs*/
*.log

# Exception: the actual policy checkpoint backing the cited 64.4% closed-loop
# result (small, 316KB) -- unlike routine training logs, this specific run
# took many hours and several non-deterministic recoveries to produce, so
# it isn't trivially reproducible on demand the way the comment above
# otherwise assumes. Worth keeping as the real artifact behind the number.
!Data/ppo_slip_policy_latest.zip

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Virtual environment
venv/
.venv/

# Claude Code project state
.claude/
